      "review": {
        "source": "Unchanged signed stable upstream sources and unmodified upstream fake Bolt protocol provider files.",
        "version": "No epoch in Ubuntu reference; stable candidate exceeds captured Ubuntu versions.",
        "dependencies": "Exact complete eligible Frameworks closure, repaired KConfig and Ubuntu Qt; preserve runtime Bolt and KCM QML modules. Matched retained Breeze Icons support input is required by KIconThemes; keep complete theme and Ubuntu transitional packages. Actual retained KIO binary dependencies require matched KDocTools runtime, supplied with its retained tool/SDK closure; Ubuntu packages cannot satisfy the newer library version.",
        "tests": "All 3 upstream tests; actual installed KDED notifications/actions and KCM QML/model on private simulated Bolt; unchanged Ubuntu SDK client and rebuilt consumer after upgrade.",
        "licensing": "Preserve upstream GPL-2-3-KDEeV, BSD CMake and LGPL dependencies; attribute copied provider files separately and CC0 CI configuration.",
        "profile": "KDED and settings UI are built and checked; no physical hardware or system-bus access in package fixture. Physical device and Wayland desktop QA remain later gates."
